WEBVTT

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
moo-shi

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
presents:

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:24.130
http://moo-shi.no-ip.info/ #moo-shi@irc.rizon.net

00:01:38.320 --> 00:01:39.830
<i>I'm Koizumi Taiko!</i>

00:01:40.320 --> 00:01:44.250
<i>I'm 14 and intent on being the
Great Kanto Desert's #1 skilled beauty!</i>

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:49.080
<i>Kosuna Change!</i>

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:52.960
<i>When trouble's afoot, I transform
into the super-equipped Kosuna</i>

00:01:52.960 --> 00:01:55.900
<i>and beat the bad desert people senseless!</i>

00:01:56.400 --> 00:01:57.840
<i>Tadah!</i>

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:00.330
<i>We give up!</i>

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:02.870
<i>I do mess up once in a while,</i>

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:05.610
<i>but my master's encouragement
helps me do my best!</i>

00:02:21.090 --> 00:02:22.220
<i>How many are there?!</i>

00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:24.860
<i>What happened?!</i>

00:02:24.860 --> 00:02:26.770
<i>Damn! A pitfall!</i>

00:02:26.770 --> 00:02:29.330
<i>- Look out! There's pitfalls everywhere!
- Or so I wish...</i>

00:02:31.440 --> 00:02:35.110
<i>Sometimes I wonder if I should
really keep doing this...</i>

00:02:35.110 --> 00:02:39.740
<i>I became his pupil so I could become
the desert's most skilled beauty,</i>

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:43.140
<i>but what I do is so far from that goal...</i>

00:02:44.710 --> 00:02:47.080
They're on the move! South-22!

00:02:48.110 --> 00:02:48.990
Hey!

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:51.590
Hey!

00:02:52.560 --> 00:02:53.390
<i>Yes?!</i>

00:02:53.390 --> 00:02:55.330
What the hell're you doing?!

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:57.760
Go get all the dummy balloons!

00:02:57.760 --> 00:02:58.890
<i>Right!</i>

00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:15.510
<i>Dammit! What's goin' on?!</i>

00:03:15.510 --> 00:03:17.420
<i>Where is he?! Where'd he go?!</i>

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:18.670
Tadah!

00:03:22.950 --> 00:03:24.520
<i>He disappeared again!</i>

00:03:24.520 --> 00:03:26.660
<i>So he IS with Kuronuma!</i>

00:03:26.660 --> 00:03:28.390
<i>Well, duh! Let's go!</i>

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:29.580
<i>Mommy!</i>

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:31.830
<i>H-hey!</i>

00:03:35.570 --> 00:03:37.440
<i>What happened to you?!</i>

00:03:37.440 --> 00:03:39.000
<i>What happened up there?!</i>

00:03:39.000 --> 00:03:40.540
<i>He even stole my undies!</i>

00:03:41.040 --> 00:03:43.410
<i>I dunno who he is, but this ain't good!</i>

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:45.500
<i>Let's get our asses back to camp!</i>

00:03:46.580 --> 00:03:48.010
<i>W-wait for me!</i>

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:50.610
<i>Ow ow! My feet are burning!</i>

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:57.770
<i>Here we are.</i>

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:02.940
<i>Two more to go...</i>

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:08.560
<i>All this work and I'm still
no closer to my goal...</i>

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:12.930
<i>Yeah, to be the Great Kanto Desert's
greatest skilled beauty!</i>

00:04:16.510 --> 00:04:18.410
<i>I got you now, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:04:18.410 --> 00:04:20.780
Damn! I can't believe
I fell into a trap!

00:04:20.780 --> 00:04:23.100
Oh no! Whatever will I do?!

00:04:23.100 --> 00:04:27.920
<i>This will be the graveyard for
the Ghost of the Desert, Sunabouzu!</i>

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:29.540
<i>Die!</i>

00:04:32.620 --> 00:04:34.940
<i>Impossible! Who could
shoot so accurately?!</i>

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:39.190
Oh, my! I'm saved in the nick of time!
Whoever could it be?!

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:44.170
<i>Handyman of the Desert,
Kosuna, at your service!</i>

00:04:44.170 --> 00:04:49.040
<i>You desert-infesting villains!
Go home right this minute!</i>

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.510
<i>What?!</i>

00:04:50.510 --> 00:04:56.300
<i>The Great Kanto Desert's greatest
skilled beauty, Kosuna-chan?!</i>

00:04:57.180 --> 00:05:00.180
<i>- I love you, Kosuna-tan!
- Gimme your autograph!</i>

00:05:00.180 --> 00:05:02.520
<i>We surrender!</i>

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:04.860
You saved me, Kosuna!

00:05:04.860 --> 00:05:07.090
You no longer need my help.

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:11.560
From this day forth, you're a
superb handyman in your own right!

00:05:11.560 --> 00:05:13.240
Congratulations!

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:17.350
<i>- Congratulations!
- Congratulations!</i>

00:05:27.440 --> 00:05:32.050
<i>At any rate, even with loser
small-fry work I need to try my hardest...</i>

00:05:32.050 --> 00:05:34.570
<i>Loser small-fry, huh?!</i>

00:05:35.520 --> 00:05:37.390
<i>Dummy balloons and a shovel!</i>

00:05:37.390 --> 00:05:41.240
<i>So YOU set this all up,
you puny wench!</i>

00:05:43.220 --> 00:05:46.090
<i>I'm gonna tear you apart!</i>

00:05:48.630 --> 00:05:50.120
<i>A bulletproof vest?!</i>

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:52.940
<i>Pipsqueak!</i>

00:05:56.970 --> 00:06:00.050
<i>What a right jab!</i>

00:06:01.650 --> 00:06:05.820
Damn bastard got deserted
by his friends and panicked...

00:06:05.820 --> 00:06:06.980
<i>Master!</i>

00:06:06.980 --> 00:06:10.290
So what were you doing?

00:06:10.290 --> 00:06:14.090
Caught by surprise or not, you still
let an unarmed jackass get you.

00:06:14.090 --> 00:06:16.570
Can't you even do backup support right?

00:06:17.030 --> 00:06:18.430
<i>I-I'm sorry...</i>

00:06:18.430 --> 00:06:22.500
You'll never get on
the front lines like that!

00:06:22.500 --> 00:06:23.600
<i>Y-yes, sir...</i>

00:06:23.600 --> 00:06:28.540
A crappy job like this normally
wouldn't even call for someone like me,

00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:31.670
yet I can't even trust
my own student to it!

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:32.480
<i>Yes, sir...</i>

00:06:32.480 --> 00:06:36.380
You think too much during work, don't ya?

00:06:36.380 --> 00:06:39.150
I bet you were
spacing off again this time!

00:06:39.150 --> 00:06:40.250
<i>Yes...</i>

00:06:40.250 --> 00:06:43.820
Geez, so you're so useless...

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:47.400
<i>"Water Station #30"</i>

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:52.160
<i>Damn it! It's jammed again!</i>

00:06:52.160 --> 00:06:53.700
<i>Guess it's no use...</i>

00:06:53.700 --> 00:06:56.970
<i>Full-autos just don't
last long in the desert...</i>

00:06:56.970 --> 00:06:58.960
<i>We'll just have to get it tuned up.</i>

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:00.560
<i>"Igarashi Gun Shop"</i>

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:00.560
<i>"Made-to-Order"</i>

00:06:59.300 --> 00:07:00.560
<i>You dolt!</i>

00:07:01.970 --> 00:07:06.710
<i>Don't be spoutin' hogwash and
forgettin' you can't handle guns right!</i>

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:08.510
<i>But, Mister!</i>

00:07:08.510 --> 00:07:09.610
<i>Shut up!</i>

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:13.280
<i>If you're that scared of trouble
then get yourself a damn knife!</i>

00:07:13.280 --> 00:07:17.520
<i>There ain't no guns in
my shop for the likes of you!</i>

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:23.960
<i>You're the same as ever,
lgarashi-meijin!</i>

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:27.360
<i>Oh, if it isn't the asshole.
Still alive, huh?</i>

00:07:28.830 --> 00:07:30.470
Thanks to you...

00:07:30.470 --> 00:07:32.140
<i>What brings you today?</i>

00:07:32.140 --> 00:07:35.270
Not me, this here brat.

00:07:36.180 --> 00:07:42.150
<i>H-hello! My name is Koizumi Taiko!
I work under Sunabouzu-sensei!</i>

00:07:43.540 --> 00:07:47.150
You see, she blames her gun
for screwing up a job

00:07:47.150 --> 00:07:51.120
and won't stop complaining
about how she wants a stronger one...

00:07:51.120 --> 00:07:54.590
<i>I hit him! But he didn't even budge!</i>

00:07:54.590 --> 00:07:57.490
<i>If I'd had a stronger gun,
I'm certain I would've beaten...</i>

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:03.130
You know it's not about if you hit him
or if the gun was strong or weak!

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:05.970
It was because you let
that moron spot you!

00:08:05.970 --> 00:08:10.000
<i>I-I realize that, but!</i>

00:08:10.630 --> 00:08:15.680
<i>But I'm upset I wasn't able to
clean up my own mess back there!</i>

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:21.850
Listen! You've started to think
too much lately... quit it!

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:24.620
Girls don't need to use their heads!

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:28.640
<i>No! I want to be able
to take care of myself!</i>

00:08:28.640 --> 00:08:29.720
<i>Alright.</i>

00:08:30.360 --> 00:08:31.600
<i>Come with me.</i>

00:08:43.570 --> 00:08:45.130
<i>Try shooting this.</i>

00:08:48.710 --> 00:08:49.910
<i>What's wrong?</i>

00:08:49.910 --> 00:08:55.690
<i>I don't want this! I want a
.308 assault rifle and a Magnum handgun!</i>

00:08:55.690 --> 00:08:58.390
Geez, will you get real?!

00:08:58.390 --> 00:09:01.390
<i>I know it's beyond me!</i>

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:05.660
<i>But I want something that can
blow someone away in one shot!</i>

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:10.510
<i>Please! I swear I'll get
good enough to master it!</i>

00:09:10.510 --> 00:09:14.590
<i>Could you show me your skill?</i>

00:09:15.740 --> 00:09:20.610
<i>I work hard to make'em. I don't
want'em to wind up useless...</i>

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:26.580
<i>All right! I'll shoot any gun you want!</i>

00:09:26.580 --> 00:09:28.220
<i>Then for starters...</i>

00:09:28.220 --> 00:09:32.920
<i>Yes?! A.223?! Or maybe
straight to A.308?!</i>

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.220
<i>...could you dig me a hole?</i>

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:39.680
<i>The shovels are right there.</i>

00:09:41.030 --> 00:09:42.970
<i>Understood!</i>

00:09:47.040 --> 00:09:50.870
<i>I'm here to buy a gun,
so why do I have to dig holes?</i>

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:55.230
<i>No! Don't you prefer the big shovel?!</i>

00:09:56.780 --> 00:09:58.740
<i>So that's the deal...</i>

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:29.480
<i>It's too long... And hard to use!</i>

00:10:29.480 --> 00:10:31.650
<i>I know what you're trying to say!</i>

00:10:31.650 --> 00:10:35.190
<i>Keep practicality in mind, right?!</i>

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:38.220
<i>Choose a gun that suits my size, right?!</i>

00:10:42.380 --> 00:10:44.870
<i>How cute!</i>

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:55.440
<i>I refuse to give in!
I absolutely won't give in!</i>

00:10:55.440 --> 00:10:59.480
<i>The guns best suited for me
are super powerful ones!</i>

00:10:59.480 --> 00:11:01.730
<i>I want A.308!</i>

00:11:01.730 --> 00:11:04.840
<i>I want a gun that's unbeatable!</i>

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:27.390
<i>So those wellionaires are still at it?</i>

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.970
Yep. In some ruins up north.

00:11:29.970 --> 00:11:32.860
<i>Kuronuma and Tomikawa, was it?</i>

00:11:32.860 --> 00:11:35.460
<i>You sure are involved
in some dinky stuff...</i>

00:11:36.280 --> 00:11:39.620
It's not my fault, it's just
a job I got from the Mugenya.

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:41.320
But it's only for a limited time,

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:45.550
until their bodyguard who got
appendicitis gets out of the hospital!

00:11:48.430 --> 00:11:51.290
Wait, don't tell me that's...

00:11:51.290 --> 00:11:54.050
<i>Impressive. You noticed.</i>

00:11:54.050 --> 00:11:55.480
So it is?!

00:11:55.980 --> 00:11:56.730
<i>Yup.</i>

00:11:56.730 --> 00:12:00.300
<i>At first glance, it doesn't
seem different from any other M2...</i>

00:12:01.100 --> 00:12:02.640
<i>...but it's a First Replica.</i>

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:09.080
<i>I assume you know all the guns
used here in the Great Kanto Desert</i>

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:13.850
<i>are replicas based on items
excavated from the Dark Age.</i>

00:12:13.850 --> 00:12:19.520
<i>Every last original dug up was
confiscated by the Oasis government,</i>

00:12:19.520 --> 00:12:24.690
<i>and after analytical studies, only stuff
deemed appropriate for civilians</i>

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:27.900
<i>was delivered to us ordinary citizens...</i>

00:12:27.900 --> 00:12:33.070
<i>They say in a high-security room
deep within a government building</i>

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:36.710
<i>lies a huge amount
of valuable originals...</i>

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:39.940
Isn't it called the Treasure Vault?

00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:44.050
<i>Yup. I've only heard
rumors about it, though.</i>

00:12:44.050 --> 00:12:47.820
<i>Supposedly there's also super-advanced
technology from the final days</i>

00:12:47.820 --> 00:12:51.590
<i>that we can't even begin to
analyze with current technology.</i>

00:12:55.660 --> 00:13:01.500
<i>And the first models made based on
those originals are First Replicas.</i>

00:13:07.440 --> 00:13:11.910
<i>Whadya think? Completely different
from all those replicas of replicas.</i>

00:13:12.840 --> 00:13:17.310
<i>From the materials to the workmanship...
It's all ultra-top-of-the-line.</i>

00:13:17.310 --> 00:13:19.880
But who's the big spender?!

00:13:19.880 --> 00:13:22.020
You'd need some major connections
with the Oasis government

00:13:22.020 --> 00:13:26.640
or some major dough
to get something like this...

00:13:26.640 --> 00:13:28.380
<i>"Specifications"</i>

00:13:29.960 --> 00:13:35.230
Don't tell me this familiar-yet-tasteless
customization belongs to...

00:13:40.280 --> 00:13:43.190
<i>Yes! It is I!</i>

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:48.800
You're as rambunctious as ever...

00:13:50.280 --> 00:13:51.530
<i>My bad.</i>

00:13:51.530 --> 00:13:55.270
<i>The Greatest Handyman
in the Desert, Sunabouzu-sama,</i>

00:13:55.270 --> 00:13:59.820
<i>must be exhausted from his big land war!</i>

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:03.490
And Amagumo-sensei played such
a big part at Dog-Girl Rock

00:14:03.490 --> 00:14:06.830
that I almost got credit for it
swiped right out from under me!

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:14.590
<i>Incidentally, Gunsmith,
how is the gun I ordered?</i>

00:14:14.590 --> 00:14:16.510
- Hey! Don't ignore me!

00:14:14.590 --> 00:14:16.510
<i>- I've been swamped.</i>

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:18.840
- Hey! Amagumo!

00:14:16.510 --> 00:14:18.840
<i>- Gimme a few more days.</i>

00:14:18.840 --> 00:14:22.980
<i>Understood. I want it to be
exactly like my previous gun.</i>

00:14:22.980 --> 00:14:26.680
<i>For that I will wait
any number of days...</i>

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:28.000
Hey, you!

00:14:29.220 --> 00:14:33.060
You seem to be doing quite well lately!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:35.530
Do repo men really make that much?!

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:37.990
<i>I've given up the repo business.</i>

00:14:37.990 --> 00:14:40.400
<i>Anyway, Gunsmith. I'll be back.</i>

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:44.270
<i>Sure. You can pay for the door then, too.</i>

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:45.900
<i>Understood...</i>

00:14:45.900 --> 00:14:47.010
Hey!

00:14:47.580 --> 00:14:50.380
<i>I'll tell you this much.</i>

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:54.840
<i>Money isn't buried under the eaves
of poor people's houses.</i>

00:14:54.840 --> 00:14:56.850
<i>Where do you think it IS buried?</i>

00:14:56.850 --> 00:14:58.080
Huh?!

00:14:58.080 --> 00:15:00.060
<i>The battlefield.</i>

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:16.780
<i>I dunno the details, but it sounds
like he found a good source of money.</i>

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:23.670
Slow and steady wins the race.

00:15:23.670 --> 00:15:25.080
What the hell is he doing,

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:28.010
quitting the repo business
after all that time?

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:33.110
<i>Who're you to talk? You don't plan
to be a handyman forever, do ya?</i>

00:15:44.930 --> 00:15:48.470
You do me too much credit!

00:15:48.470 --> 00:15:50.190
<i>I guess I do!</i>

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:53.740
<i>Well, let's go!</i>

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:54.490
Eh?

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:56.710
<i>She must be spent by now.</i>

00:15:56.710 --> 00:15:57.740
Eh?

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:14.420
Hey, you alive?

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:16.090
<i>I was...</i>

00:16:16.090 --> 00:16:16.780
<i>Here.</i>

00:16:18.330 --> 00:16:20.190
<i>W-water!</i>

00:16:24.530 --> 00:16:27.400
Moron. You tried too hard!

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:29.310
<i>B-but!</i>

00:16:29.310 --> 00:16:30.800
<i>Here.</i>

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:35.010
<i>This is what you want, isn't it?</i>

00:16:42.620 --> 00:16:46.060
<i>A.308 full-auto FN-FAL.</i>

00:16:46.060 --> 00:16:50.250
<i>It's a tad heavier than the G3 series,
but a good desert gun.</i>

00:16:54.460 --> 00:16:56.450
<i>I-it's heavy!</i>

00:17:03.970 --> 00:17:05.100
<i>But!</i>

00:17:07.740 --> 00:17:09.920
One shot from 150 meters?!

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:19.850
H-holy crap...

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:23.360
<i>My word!</i>

00:17:26.530 --> 00:17:30.570
<i>It's too strong!
My shoulder's already hurting...</i>

00:17:30.570 --> 00:17:33.040
<i>And its weight and kickback are insane...</i>

00:17:33.040 --> 00:17:36.750
<i>It's so long and heavy and big!</i>

00:17:58.460 --> 00:18:00.800
<i>An AK jumps even more.</i>

00:18:00.800 --> 00:18:06.030
<i>That's too light. What do you say?
Would you like to try some others?</i>

00:18:07.040 --> 00:18:11.340
<i>I have an M14 and a Model 64...</i>

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:15.180
<i>It's too much for me after all.</i>

00:18:15.180 --> 00:18:20.150
<i>It'd be so hard to lug this thing
and spare ammo all around the desert.</i>

00:18:20.150 --> 00:18:22.020
<i>That it'd get in the way of work.</i>

00:18:22.590 --> 00:18:25.610
<i>There's no question
I'd be a burden on my master.</i>

00:18:28.190 --> 00:18:33.130
<i>A gun is a tool. Whether a tool
saves or kills depends on the user.</i>

00:18:33.130 --> 00:18:36.770
<i>Just having a good tool
doesn't make you stronger.</i>

00:18:36.770 --> 00:18:38.700
<i>Just look at him.</i>

00:18:40.240 --> 00:18:41.350
Me?

00:18:41.850 --> 00:18:47.050
<i>In all my 55 years I've never
seen anyone as despicable as him.</i>

00:18:48.610 --> 00:18:51.760
<i>He's cowardly, stingy,
scrawny, and spiteful...</i>

00:18:51.760 --> 00:18:55.330
<i>And I dunno why,
but he's garishly overbearing.</i>

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:58.420
Gunsmith! Come on, that's not very...

00:18:58.420 --> 00:18:59.440
<i>But...</i>

00:19:01.960 --> 00:19:05.500
<i>But what ticks me off the most</i>

00:19:05.500 --> 00:19:09.730
<i>is that this bastard treks across
this hellish Great Kanto Desert</i>

00:19:09.730 --> 00:19:13.390
<i>with the shabby shotgun he got
as a memento from his old man.</i>

00:19:18.980 --> 00:19:22.330
<i>A.308 and .223.
A rocket launcher with grenades.</i>

00:19:22.330 --> 00:19:25.440
<i>He's even made sport
of an armed hovercraft</i>

00:19:25.440 --> 00:19:28.230
<i>and continues to live
a happy-go-lucky life.</i>

00:19:28.230 --> 00:19:30.570
<i>All with that run-of-the-mill shotgun.</i>

00:19:32.890 --> 00:19:39.460
<i>Not to mention it's plainly obvious
he's lived a dirty, scummy life.</i>

00:19:39.460 --> 00:19:43.050
No, I'm just living life
to the fullest!

00:19:43.050 --> 00:19:45.470
<i>You see? Isn't he a scumbag?</i>

00:19:45.470 --> 00:19:46.500
<i>Yes!</i>

00:19:47.010 --> 00:19:48.780
<i>I think he's a very strong person!</i>

00:19:59.200 --> 00:20:02.140
<i>I see! A strong person, eh?!</i>

00:20:05.620 --> 00:20:09.680
<i>It was then that I finally understood.</i>

00:20:10.390 --> 00:20:16.370
<i>What I really wanted
wasn't a powerful gun.</i>

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:19.060
<i>No, it was...</i>

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:27.880
<i>Wow!</i>

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:29.210
<i>Whadya think?</i>

00:20:29.210 --> 00:20:31.480
<i>It's perfect! It fits great in my hands!</i>

00:20:31.480 --> 00:20:33.980
<i>Hold on. I gotta fix one last thing.</i>

00:20:33.980 --> 00:20:34.480
<i>OK!</i>

00:20:34.480 --> 00:20:35.420
Hey.

00:20:36.020 --> 00:20:37.490
<i>What is it, Master?</i>

00:20:37.490 --> 00:20:40.760
That 9-mm submachine gun
doesn't pack much of a punch,

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:43.130
and it's pretty hard to master.

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:47.490
<i>R-right! I'll work hard
to make it my own!</i>

00:20:48.350 --> 00:20:50.500
I look forward to seeing that happen.

00:20:50.500 --> 00:20:52.100
Dammit!

00:20:52.100 --> 00:20:58.000
This means Igarashi judged her
to have enough skill to master it!

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:02.810
<i>So, let me make this clear right now!</i>

00:21:02.810 --> 00:21:03.530
<i>Yes?!</i>

00:21:05.280 --> 00:21:10.980
Hot girls with giant boobs don't need
to be independent to live!

00:21:13.860 --> 00:21:15.590
<i>Damn! Retreat!</i>

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:17.360
<i>I can't tell where he is!</i>

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:18.780
<i>Retreat! Retreat!</i>

00:21:21.360 --> 00:21:23.970
<i>- A pitfall!
- Watch out!</i>

00:21:23.970 --> 00:21:25.250
<i>It's a trap!</i>

00:21:31.940 --> 00:21:32.880
<i>He disappeared!</i>

00:21:32.880 --> 00:21:36.330
Kosuna! I've neutralized
the South-11 enemies!

00:21:36.730 --> 00:21:38.480
Get to work on the North-8 stuff!

00:21:38.480 --> 00:21:40.950
I'm gonna flush out the rest of 'em!

00:21:40.950 --> 00:21:41.890
<i>Roger!</i>

00:21:41.890 --> 00:21:43.410
<i>I've been stripped!</i>

00:21:51.490 --> 00:21:53.540
<i>I still haven't shot a single bullet...</i>

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:56.050
<i>No, no!</i>

00:21:59.240 --> 00:22:02.770
<i>Quit thinking about stuff! Work, work!</i>

00:22:02.770 --> 00:22:07.070
<i>It seems like all I do is dig holes...
but it's all part of my training!</i>

00:22:11.450 --> 00:22:14.320
<i>What I really wanted...</i>

00:22:14.320 --> 00:22:21.520
<i>Yes, I'm certain it was a strong heart
that could accept my weakness...</i>

00:23:56.910 --> 00:23:59.980
<i>Yay! I finally have a theme song!
I guess I'm the new main character!</i>

00:23:59.980 --> 00:24:01.520
<i>You wish! Wait, this isn't
the normal preview song!</i>

00:24:01.520 --> 00:24:03.830
<i>Next time is the start
of "Magical Kosuna-tan"!</i>

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:06.400
<i>Episode 1 is "Idiot Frog
in Dog-Ear Mode"! Everyone laugh!</i>

00:24:06.400 --> 00:24:08.510
<i>Next time is really-
"Siblings and Childhood Friends"!</i>

00:24:08.510 --> 00:24:10.720
<i>Miss it and it WILL turn
into a cutesy anime!</i>
